  "summary": "I am a software engineer and a USN veteran with a passion for developing comprehensive applications using JavaScript for both front-end and back-end development. I have experience in utilizing popular frameworks and technologies such as React, Node.js, and Express, as well as SQL/NoSQL databases.\n\nRecently I worked as a software engineer at Chronos, where I have implemented React Hooks, TypeScript, Grafana, and other tools to improve the UI/UX, code quality, and performance of our application. I have also contributed to open-source projects, such as Lift Log and Recipe Rescue, where I have leveraged React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and other technologies to create dynamic and user-friendly interfaces and features. Additionally, I have shared my knowledge and insights on load balancers as part of Jeeny and Bracktlet speaker series. My goal is to continue learning and growing as a software engineer and to apply my skills and expertise to create impactful and innovative solutions.",
