    "description": "● Implemented React Hooks, such as useState, useEffect, and useContext, along with React Context, to manage component state, lifecycle methods, and prop passing. This approach facilitates easier debugging, improves code readability and maintainability, and increases application efficiency.\n● Refactored existing code to TypeScript, reducing silent errors and making debugging easier, resulting in improvements to the overall robustness and maintainability of the codebase.\n● Improved UI/UX by fixing sidebar overlapping main content, resulting in a cleaner interface, better accessibility, and adherence to UI/UX best practices.\n● Implemented Grafana as visual data graphs, making the application easier to navigate and more intuitive.\n● Utilized Electron to simplify and streamline the development of cross-platform desktop applications, and deploy them across multiple operating systems without the need for platform-specific code.\n● Employed Jest's robust testing suite, along with React -Testing -Library, to thoroughly test our front-end components for data accuracy, functionality, and DOM integration, benefiting from Jest's user-friendly syntax and error messages.\n● Partnered with tech accelerator, OSLabs, to develop version 9.0 of an open-source project with 615+ GitHub stars.",
